From bded866c7e688480f8170002feda77517e3c2ae1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:39:29 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] test(post,sim): fold the flat integration tests into
 domain directory suites

camcraft-post had 143 flat test binaries and camcraft-sim had 95. Each
old file is now a module of a directory suite: 9 suites in post, 8 in
sim. The test list is the same: 2353 tests before and after, each with
its module prefix added.

Shared helpers (recorded, inverted_support, mirror_trace, macro_b,
ac_trunnion_support) are declared once in each suite's main.rs. Relative
include and #[path] paths gain one "../". The recorded helper's temp
files get a per-process counter, because one process now runs the
script modules in parallel.

Fixes #3188

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
