From 0f23cfb1361f82dde763f7488e76d905e428df37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:55:43 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] test(xtask): point the asset and gate-map pins at the
 folded post and sim suites

Six xtask tests named post and sim test binaries that are now modules of
directory suites (fanuc_post in script_dialects, heidenhain_cycles in
script_cycles, arc_planes in script_arcs, and so on). They now name the
suite. moved_suites_live_in_their_owner_crate_and_not_in_app reads all
sources of a directory suite.

The comment in crates/post/src/post/upright_after_tilt.rs goes back to
main: it put about 70 app suites into the gate for one comment. A
follow-up updates the old paths in code comments.

Refs #3188

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
